cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Multi-refinery ADMM disclosure reproducibility package"
message: >
  If you use this repository, please cite the associated manuscript
  and the upstream refinery-petrochemical benchmark (see NOTICE.md).
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sweetienite/multi-refinery-admm-disclosure"
version: "v1.2.0-paper-final-20260727"
date-released: "2026-07-27"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - refinery planning
  - ADMM
  - distributed optimization
  - commercial information disclosure
  - production planning
  - multi-refinery coordination
  - individual rationality
abstract: >
  Reproducibility package for the manuscript "ADMM-based coordinated production
  planning and commercial information disclosure control for multi-refinery systems".
  Includes Python implementations of the centralized LP reference model, ADMM
  capacity-sharing approximation, individual-rationality transfer-payment interval
  calculation, and observable commercial information exposure metrics.
